      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "3130DF5AA9E6DE71",
      "text": "Nö, keine Lust.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "E6DB38293EA35109",
      "text": "Hehehe! Ich bin so begeistert, ich muss es einfach\\nbei irgendwem loswerden.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_01b",
      "hash64": "E9D1D9156F8358D1",
      "text": "Hä? Was ist denn mit dir los? Es dauert auch nicht\\nlange, also sag ich’s dir einfach.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "E6DB35293EA34BF0",
      "text": "Ich durfte die Anlage besichtigen, die unter der\\nAkademie liegt! Und es war total krass!!![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "E6DB36293EA34DA3",
      "text": "Ich war am Eingang der Akademie und gerade\\ndabei, Informationen nachzuschlagen...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "E6DB3B293EA35622",
      "text": "Da taucht plötzlich dieser gestriegelte Opi im\\nweißen Anzug auf und führt mich lachend runter\\r\\nin die Anlage![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "E6DB3C293EA357D5",
      "text": "Ich frag mich, wer das wohl war...\\c\\nVielleicht war es ja eine gute Fee, die sich als\\nälterer Herr verkleidet hat...![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_select_03",
      "hash64": "3130DE5AA9E6DCBE",
      "text": "Wer weiß!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_select_04",
      "hash64": "3130E15AA9E6E1D7",
      "text": "Das war der Direktor...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "E6DB39293EA352BC",
      "text": "Ja, oder?! Er hatte auch so eine Aura...\\c\\nIch glaube, ich werde mal Nachforschungen zu\\nder schicken Opi-Fee anstellen.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_sp03_06b",
      "hash64": "E9D4FF156F85CF3A",
      "text": "Was..? Das war der Direktor?!\\c\\nIch meine, an unserer Akademie ist es ja ähnlich...\\nOb wohl alle Direktoren etwas exzentrisch sind?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "4E17A931A687F130",
      "text": "Die Blaubeer-Akademie ist wirklich toll. Ich war\\nmir am Anfang etwas unsicher, aber letztendlich\\r\\nbin ich froh, dass ich hergekommen bin.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "4E17AA31A687F2E3",
      "text": "Das sag ich jetzt nicht nur, um mich für deine\\nEinladung zu bedanken, aber...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "4E17AB31A687F496",
      "text": "Hast du nicht vielleicht Lust, ein Pokémon mit mir\\nzu tauschen?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_paldea_botan_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "4E17AC31A687F649",
      "text": "Okay! Von mir bekommst du natürlich ein Evoli.\\nUnd zwar ein besonders heldenhaftes!\\r\\nWas bietest du mir dafür an?[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
